OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 10 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores the
OL,6,     Gorigins and evolution of George
OL,7,     GGershwin's opera Porgy and Bess.
OL,8,G1700FIn Tune
OL,9,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,10,     Gthe Urban Folk Quartet and
OL,11,     Gpianist Hanni Liang.
OL,12,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,13,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,14,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,15,     Gfavourites.
OL,16,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,17,     GJerome Kuhn conducts the BBC
OL,18,     GConcert Orchestra in music which
OL,19,     Gfeatures American songs from
OL,20,     Gsoprano Alison Scherzer. Recorded
OL,21,     Gat Chichester Festival Theatre in
OL,22,     GJanuary.
